          "topic": "Faraday’s law and Lenz’s law",
          "content_type": "worked_example",
          "text": "A 20-turn coil experiences a flux change of 0.01 Wb per turn in 0.1 s. The average induced emf magnitude is NΔΦ/Δt = 20 × 0.01/0.1 = 2 V.",
